{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261017/photo/bkn-20261017103015864-1017_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261017121606\"/><p>事主由直升機救起送院。</p><p>西貢有人行山不適。今日(17日)早上10時06分，一名女子與一行16人由西貢黃石碼頭出發登山遠足。期間途至近蛋家灣時，女子突然感到不適，並吐血及出現抽筋，同行山友見狀慌忙報案求助。救援人員接報登山拯救，政府飛行服務隊派出直升機到場協助，最終將事主吊起送往東區醫院治理。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T04:19:05.338486+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":154,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T02:30:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T05:18:07.935413+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T04:17:41.552287+00:00","content_hash":"31a1657a3e4982f194a3871e108ff5f6b0c757b6b0403e59e47346ddbc415811","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}